{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949010/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.poster.avif?t=1755894179\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949010/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.webm?t=1755894179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step aboard and brace for impact!</strong><br>This demo of <i>A Spaceship Accident</i> lets you play the initial accident aboard the damaged vessel and explore the first planet you can reach, if you survive that long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This is a game of choices, consequences, and multiple endings. Characters\u2019 fates will shift with each decision you make, and the demo is designed to be replayed several times to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single run can take anywhere from one  minute to a full 30-minute adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the full game, you will be able to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate with an alien queen, or kill her. Become a cosmic entity, talk to a stone to discover the secrets of the universe, become a space pirate or a parasite-infected horror. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drift through cold, unforgiving space, stranded far from Earth and desperate to return home. Strange worlds lie before you, each ripe with secrets and cosmic dread. Mystery haunts every alien landscape and forgotten starship, where even the silence feels alive and foreboding. Driven by the hope of reuniting with your daughter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949010/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.poster.avif?t=1755894179\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949010/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.webm?t=1755894179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust RPG mechanics: level-up progression, turn-based combat, inventory management, bartering, skill checks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A soundtrack 100% made by humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-crafted illustrations (also completely human-made)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich story packed with smart or absurd choices that will get you killed in interesting ways (last time I checked, AI couldn't crack a joke).</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to your Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949010/1d1bd9fb524a9315854fac426f506368ebf5367c.jpg"},{"name":"Interspecies Ambassador","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949010/cae1e17ddd7b625dd42daf65aa2bd66260995b3e.jpg"},{"name":"Space Pirate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949010/9110ca66914292089bdd425527f706ebaa252683.jpg"},{"name":"Back on Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949010/95363ee82bfe0ce4e6f3fa877d5991ac46301761.jpg"},{"name":"Tool Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949010/fa2953208411ee6af86ec83a7c357ed32a67448c.jpg"},{"name":"Dreamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949010/0f7fbbfc123e325138b123c8426e67c917a8a5a7.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949010?t=1755894179","backg